content:
Lying the cauldron can be seen the following:
A broken teacup with an intricate design;
a bundle of herbs and spices containing orange rind, vanilla, molasses, licorice, star anise, and pine leaves;
a vial of swirling black and white blood;
a bloody pocketwatch;
and a shard of horn, glowing a bright white.

No retrieval of items is required for Eloise's ressurection.
